 collections, etc.\\\" shown under assets. Treasurer's checks outstanding are included\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [822, 1600, 1572, 1806], \"page_id\": 34}], \"content\": \"through June 1958, after which they are included in the balance in the Treasurer's account. (See footnote 2).\\n2/ Through June 1958, the balance of the Treasurer was reduced when Treasurer's checks were issued and the amount of the checks was carried as a liability until paid. Effective July 1958, the balance is not reduced until the checks are paid, a procedure also applying to checks drawn on the Treasurer by Government disbursing officers and agencies.\\n3/ Amounts shown, beginning January 1963, are net of uncollected items, exchanges, etc. Previously these items were included under liabilities.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [38, 34, 244, 70], \"page_id\": 35}], \"content\": \"March 1965\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1529, 46, 1561, 70], \"page_id\": 35}], \"content\": \"21\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [499, 109, 1111, 131], \"page_id\": 35}], \"content\": \"ACCOUNT OF THE TREASURER OF THE UNITED STATES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [336, 179, 1258, 208], \"page_id\": 35}], \"content\": \"Table 2.- Analysis of Changes in Tax and Loan Account Balances\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [34, 233, 1569, 996], \"page_id\": 35}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Fiscal year or month</th><th colspan=\\\"5\\\">Credits</th><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Total credits</th><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">With-drawala</th><th colspan=\\\"4\\\">Balance</th></tr><tr><th>Proceeds from sales of securities 1/ Savings bonds</th><th>Retire-ment plan bonds 2/</th><th>T