 1963 through June 30, 1964 (acts of July 1, 1962, May 29, 1963, August 27, 1963, and November 26, 1963, and an additional $6 billion, making a total of $30 billion, from December 1, 1963, through June 29, 1964 (act of November 26, 1963)); $39 billion from June 29, 1964 through June 30, 1965 (act of June 29, 1964); and $43 billion from July 1, 1965 through June 30, 1966 (act of June 24, 1965).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [401, 527, 1160, 568], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Table 1.- Status Under Limitation February 28, 1966\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [644, 573, 889, 599], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [12, 613, 1540, 805], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Maximum amount of securities which may be outstanding at any one time under limitation imposed by the act of June 30, 1959 (31 U.S.C. 757b), as increased temporarily by the act of June 24, 1965.</td><td>328,000</td></tr><tr><td>Amount of securities outstanding subject to such statutory debt limitation:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>U. S. Government securities issued under the Second Liberty Bond Act, as amended.</td><td>323,031</td></tr><tr><td>Guaranteed securities held outside the Treasury.</td><td>435</td></tr><tr><td>Total amount of securities outstanding subject to statutory debt limitation.</td><td>323,466</td></tr><tr><td>Balance issuable under limitation.</td><td>4,534</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [219, 808, 1349, 863], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Table 2.- Application of Limitation to Public Debt and Guaranteed Securities Outstanding February 28, 1966\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [652, 875, 907, 913], \"page_id\": 43}], \"cont