orical data seems challenging to locate, with many online resources returning blocks or errors. I'll need to dig deeper into historical financial records or consult specialized databases to extract these exact exchange rates.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_092b14a8b100d0cb","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -sL \"https://www.oecd.org\" 2>/dev/null | head -10"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
