 and 1965 securities using the 1964 rate, then finding their ratio.\n\nThe comparison continues with the 1966 securities conversion, using the 1965 exchange rate. I'll track how the securities amounts transform when converted to Indian Rupees, revealing the underlying economic dynamics.\n\nThe question seems to be asking about the change in USD securities, which appears minimal. However, the request involves converting these amounts to INR using specific annual rates, adding complexity to the calculation.\n\nThe next step involves determining the precise exchange rates, which requires additional investigation to ensure accuracy.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_c052e249d97032d9","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -sL \"https://www.bis.org/c RBI_pg/publ/stat_archview.htm?in=8&x=THESTMPG__1627488\" 2>/dev/null | head -20"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
