y is understanding how the conversion works between 1964 and 1965 exchange rates. Essentially, I'm looking at how the securities' value changes when converted using different year exchange rates.\n\nThe core idea seems to be comparing the value when converted at different exchange rates, which helps understand the currency fluctuation's impact on the securities value.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_9d0658afa30bfd8e","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -sL \"https://ddgapi.herokuapp.com/?q=USD+to+INR+1964+1965+average+exchange+rate\" 2>/dev/null"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
